tion.</text></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="DZ1BYMNButxVx4jPWCuX-346"><g transform="translate(0.5,0.5)"><rect x="455.5" y="114" width="503" height="24" fill="none" stroke="none" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g fill="#151515" font-family="'Arial Narrow'" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="start" font-size="21.5px" style="fill: light-dark(rgb(21, 21, 21), rgb(219, 219, 219));"><text x="455.5" y="135.75">2. Detailed Multi-modal CrossViT Fault Diagnosis Model</text></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="DZ1BYMNButxVx4jPWCuX-347"><g transform="translate(0.5,0.5)"><rect x="64.5" y="114" width="215" height="24" fill="none" stroke="none" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g fill="#151515" font-family="'Arial Narrow'" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="start" font-size="19.61px" style="fill: light-dark(rgb(21, 21, 21), rgb(219, 219, 219));"><text x="64.5" y="134.81">1. Data Preprocessing &amp;</text></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="DZ1BYMNButxVx4jPWCuX-348"><g transform="translate(0.5,0.5)"><rect x="62.5" y="144" width="227" height="22" fill="none" stroke="none" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g fill="#111111" font-family="'Arial Narrow'" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="start" font-size="19.22px" style="fill: light-dark(rgb(17, 17, 17), rgb(223, 223, 223));"><text x="62.5" y="163.61">Multi-modal Construction</text></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="DZ1BYMNButxVx4jPWCuX-349"><g transform="translate(0.5,0.5)"><rect x="59.5" y="476.5" width="241" height="17" fill="none" stroke="none" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g fill="#413d41" font-family="'Arial Narrow'" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.21px" style="fill: light-dark(rgb(65, 61, 65), rgb(187, 183, 187));"><text x="59.5" y="490.6">Fixed-length sliding-window segmentation</text></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="DZ1BYMNButxVx4jPWCuX-350"><g transform="translate(0.5,0.5)"><rect x="1386.25" y="137.49" width="171" height="22.02" fill="none" stroke="none" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g fill="#151515" font-family="'Arial Narrow'" font-weight="bold" tex